Title: Oxwich Eels x 4
Type: print
Media: cartridge paper, ink
Size: 25cm x 25cm
Tags: relief print, linocut, eel, rockpools
Date: 2026
-----

This was carved from softcut using Essdee tools.
The eel is carved positive and negative, clockwise and anticlockwise.
Hand printed using a baren, Cranfield Caligo ink on seawhite cartridge paper.

It was inspired by a small conger eel found in the rockpools at Oxwich Bay on a low tide.

